{{Documentation/Header}}
Wraps content in a collapsible <code>NavFrame</code> box with a clickable header. The box starts '''collapsed'''.

==Syntax==
{{T|Showhide|block=1
|v1=header
|v2=content
}}

==Example==
{{T|Showhide|Click to expand|Hidden content goes here.|_Y_=1}}

{{clr}}
{| class="dataTable sortable"
! Parameter !! Aliases !! Label !! Description !! Type !! Default !! Status
|-
| <code>1</code> || – || Header || Always-visible header text that toggles the box. || string || – || <span style="color:red;font-weight:bold;">Required</span>
|-
| <code>2</code> || – || Content || The content revealed when expanded. || content || – ||
|}

==See also==
* {{T|Scrollbox}} — for long content that should scroll rather than collapse

